@startuml "Gestion des connexions base de données"

title Gestion des connexions base de données

participant "API Gateway\n(Next.js API)" as API
participant "Business Services" as Services
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

API -> DB: Request connection
DB -> DB: Get from connection pool
DB --> API: Database connection

API -> Services: Execute business logic
Services -> DB: Execute queries
DB --> Services: Query results
Services --> API: Processed data

API -> DB: Release connection
DB -> DB: Return to pool

@enduml